        "body": ">keeping `1-` consistent is the way to go\r\n>\r\nNow I made it open `vim.fn.getcwd(-1, -1, -1)` in all scenarios to maintain consistency.\r\n\r\n@justinmk @barrettruth Does this seem like a useful change? I like having a way to shortcut to my global CWD when I'm browsing my filesystem but I guess it's also trivial to implement this yourself.",
